  id: shadow_stalker
  displayName: Shadow Stalker
  description: In an old Kin night-watch tower in the Lowlands. Was once a guard
    captain.
  tier: 1
  family: 2
  behaviors:
  - Uses environmental shadows to disappear.
  - Comes from above as often as from the sides.
  - "Reads player's movement \u2014 circles to opposite side."
  - Throws blades from stealth, then closes for finisher.
  abilities:
  - "Twin Blade Throw \u2014 dual ranged attack from stealth"
  - "Shadow Step \u2014 teleports between dark zones"
  - "Finisher Lunge \u2014 closes gap from any direction"
  - "Smoke Veil \u2014 creates shadow zone for cover"
  dropItemIds:
  - Stalker's Mask (stealth armor)
  - Curved Blade Fragment (weapon mat)
  - Black Silk (silk cable alt)
  - Spirit Anchor
  boss_section: Hunter Family
  isBoss: 1
  isFinale: 0
  baseHealth: 30
  baseSpeed: 4
